    <summary>Represents an HTTP CONNECT request being sent to the proxy server.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents an HTTP CONNECT request being sent to the proxy server.</para>
      <para>All methods may be called synchronously or asynchronously, on any thread.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/http/Proxy.HttpConnectCallback.Request" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.http.Proxy.HttpConnectCallback.Request</code>.</a></format></para>
